WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Welcome to the NB office safety walkthrough.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Fire exits are marked in green. Keep every exit route clear.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Extinguishers are next to each exit. Use CO2 on electrical fires.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Report spills, hazards and near misses to your supervisor within 24 hours.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
In an emergency, leave by the stairs and meet at the assembly point.
